fix: QR camera scan - add jsQR decoder for real-time QR detection

- Root cause: toggleCamera() only opened camera stream without any
  QR decoding logic - frames were never analyzed
- Added jsQR CDN library for QR code decoding
- Camera frames captured via canvas and decoded in requestAnimationFrame loop
- Auto-fills code input and triggers scanCode() on QR detection
- Visual feedback: scan frame overlay, animated scan line, status text
- Camera button state changes (text/color) when active
- Proper cleanup on camera stop
